<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκουρ-έω</span></b> , usu. in pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watch</i> or <i>keep the house,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σηκὸν φυλάσσει . .</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκουρῶν ὄφις</span>”
				<i>watching,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1328
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν οἰ.</span>
			<i>guarding</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				809
			</span></i> : generally, <i>keep safe, guard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1060
			</span></i> ; <i>keep watch</i> in a temple, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν οἰκουρῶσι μύσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					56.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>keep at home,</i> as women, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				343
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰ. ἔνδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					451d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				59.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				18
			</span></i> ; of persons who <i>stay at home</i> and avoid military
			service, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕβδομον οἰ. μῆνα πολιορκοῦντες</span>
			<i>idle away</i> seven months in the siege, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. (Impf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκ-</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠκ-</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				2.50
			</span></i> H.: 2sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκούρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lex.Mess.</u>
					p.413
				</span></i>
			.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
